    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bc3b6a5faf36865956e6e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💃读万卷书行万里路，总有一个得实现吧。在休息的日子里，选择去看远方；在打工的日子里，选择去回顾旅游的快乐。和我们一起陷入回忆吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：三言 小羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期剧透：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 难忘的旅行记录之维多利亚港湾上的烟花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 难忘的旅行记录之塞波黑街头被邀请合照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 旅游的初衷是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 什么时候旅游也开始攀比了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 快乐的阈值提高了，那就去旅游吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> 当旅游开始变味。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 当旅游越来越同质化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 当到处都是网红打卡点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> 当遍地都是约拍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 会有排斥旅游的时候吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 对旅行的期待是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2131">35:31</a> 好的旅游搭子是旅游成功的第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 要注重体验而非占有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 半J半P旅游法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 允许旅游没有宏大的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 旅行目的地大种草</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Flower Day</span></p><span></span><p><span>Echo of You</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信 syteashop（加听友群）</span></p>]]></description>
