    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong><span>三言、小羊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期剧透：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 你是社交浓人还是社交淡人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 亲密关系：寄予厚望的分享欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 亲密关系中真的需要无话不说吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 朋友：不同的话题搭子适配不同的分享场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 过去的老朋友还能承载现在的分享欲吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 同事：浅尝辄止的分享欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 自己：不离不弃的分享对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 可是，我的分享欲消失了......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 专注自己的事情，主动放弃分享欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a> 分享对象缺失，分享欲被动消散</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 分享欲没有消失，但会转移</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 没有输入就没有输出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 回应是分享欲的最终闭环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 缺失锻炼导致表达能力下降</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 如果表达没有用，那就不去表达了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> 低能量状态下，连表达都变得费力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> E人一定比I人更有分享欲吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 我们理想的分享欲&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Peter Pan Was Right - Anson Seabra</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信 syteashop（加听友群）</span></p>]]></description>
